      outlineWidth: 2
      text: "WALK        W / S, arrows, left stick, D-pad\nTURN        A / D, arrows, right stick, mouse with the right button\nRUN         Left Shift, stick click, right bumper\nUSE         E, Space, left click, pad A or X\nFIRE        Ctrl, F, right trigger, pad B\nWEAPONS     1 to 4, left bumper\nMAP         Tab, pad Y        SAVE / LOAD   F6 / F9\nPAUSE       Escape, pad Start"
